{"id": "M30", "desc": "run.rs QuicHosting::intake: on a failed pump the observer is still called with an empty report, then the error is returned (quic.rs QuicPumpReport::new made pub(crate) so it compiles; first variant, which swallowed the error, was killed by fa_6_intake_error_is_the_loop_error only)", "contract": "B-3 Ok only", "edits": [{"file": "run.rs", "old": "        let report = self.quic.pump(now_ms)?;\n", "new": "        let report = match self.quic.pump(now_ms) {\n            Ok(report) => report,\n            Err(e) => {\n                if let Some(observer) = self.observer.as_mut() {\n                    observer(now_ms, &QuicPumpReport::new());\n                }\n                return Err(e);\n            }\n        };\n"}, {"file": "quic.rs", "old": "impl QuicPumpReport {\n    fn new() -> Self {\n", "new": "impl QuicPumpReport {\n    pub(crate) fn new() -> Self {\n"}], "status": "killed", "failed_tests": ["fx_a2_a_failed_pump_calls_no_observer"], "seconds": 55.4}
